  "chapter": 80,
  "verses": [
    {
      "id": "PSA.80.1",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.80.1",
      "verse": 1,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Give ear, O Shepherd of Israel,\nThou that leadest Joseph like a flock;\nThou that sittest ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "above",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " the cherubim, shine forth.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.80.2",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.80.2",
      "verse": 2,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Before Ephraim and Benjamin and Manasseh, stir up thy might,\nAnd come to save us.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.80.3",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.80.3",
      "verse": 3,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Turn us again, O God;\nAnd cause thy face to shine, and we shall be saved.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.80.4",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.80.4",
      "verse": 4,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "O Jehovah God of hosts,\nHow long wilt thou be angry against the prayer of thy people?",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.80.5",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.80.5",
      "verse": 5,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Thou hast fed them with the bread of tears,\nAnd given them tears to drink in large measure.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.80.6",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.80.6",
      "verse": 6,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Thou makest us a strife unto our neighbors;\nAnd our enemies laugh among themselves.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.80.7",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.80.7",
      "verse": 7,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Turn us again, O God of hosts;\nAnd cause thy face to shine, and we shall be saved.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.80.8",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.80.8",
      "verse": 8,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Thou broughtest a vine out of Egypt:\nThou didst drive out the nations, and plantedst it.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.80.9",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.80.9",
      "verse": 9,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Thou preparedst ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "room",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " before it,\nAnd it took deep root, and filled the land.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.80.10",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.80.10",
      "verse": 10,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "The mountains were covered with the shadow of it,\nAnd the boughs thereof were ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "like",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " cedars of God.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.80.11",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.80.11",
      "verse": 11,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "It sent out its branches unto the sea,\nAnd its shoots unto the River.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.80.12",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.80.12",
      "verse": 12,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Why hast thou broken down its walls,\nSo that all they that pass by the way do pluck it?",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.80.13",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.80.13",
      "verse": 13,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "The boar out of the wood doth ravage it,\nAnd the wild beasts of the field feed on it.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.80.14",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.80.14",
      "verse": 14,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Turn again, we beseech thee, O God of hosts:\nLook down from heaven, and behold, and visit this vine,",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.80.15",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.80.15",
      "verse": 15,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And the stock which thy right hand planted,\nAnd the branch that thou madest strong for thyself.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.80.16",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.80.16",
      "verse": 16,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "It is burned with fire, it is cut down:\nThey perish at the rebuke of thy countenance.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.80.17",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.80.17",
      "verse": 17,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Let thy hand be upon the man of thy right hand,\nUpon the son of man whom thou madest strong for thyself.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.80.18",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.80.18",
      "verse": 18,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "So shall we not go back from thee:\nQuicken thou us, and we will call upon thy name.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.80.19",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.80.19",
      "verse": 19,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Turn us again, O Jehovah God of hosts;\nCause thy face to shine, and we shall be saved.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    }
  ],
  "headings": [
    {
